sequenceDiagram
    actor Founder
    participant Edge as Pi Meeting Recorder
    participant Meet as Meeting Intelligence Service
    participant Obj as Object Storage
    participant Queue as PostgreSQL Task Queue
    participant STT as WhisperX/Faster Whisper
    participant Dia as pyannote Adapter
    participant NLP as spaCy Extraction
    participant Admin as Review UI
    participant Verify as Verification Adapter
    participant State as Business State Service

    Founder->>Edge: "Start this meeting"
    Edge->>Meet: create meeting(idempotency_key)
    Meet-->>Edge: meeting_id + recording policy
    Edge->>Edge: LED recording + segmented WAV
    loop Each audio part
        Edge->>Meet: upload manifest + checksum
        Meet->>Obj: store encrypted audio part
        Obj-->>Meet: object_ref + checksum
        Meet-->>Edge: acknowledged part
    end
    Founder->>Edge: stop / physical button
    Edge->>Meet: stop meeting
    Meet->>Queue: enqueue transcription job
    Queue->>STT: transcribe audio parts
    STT-->>Meet: words + timestamps
    Queue->>Dia: diarize
    Dia-->>Meet: speaker segments
    Meet->>NLP: reconcile utterances and extract draft
    NLP-->>Meet: evidence-linked decisions/commitments
    Meet-->>Admin: review package
    Admin->>Meet: approve/edit/reject
    Meet->>Queue: schedule approved verification
    Queue->>Verify: observe target at deadline
    Verify->>State: certified metric/API evidence
    State-->>Verify: observation + provenance
    Verify-->>Meet: VERIFIED / BREACHED / UNVERIFIABLE
